# The Tigress Strikes (crystalWar 18), the edges: a level 99 Warrior in Windurst Waters [S], The Tigress Stirs accepted
# (missions as the main flow). Dhea Prandoleh: The Tigress Stirs' 131 (this quest's check fails). The Tigress Stirs
# completed (a GM): 133, finished with option 1: begun (any option). Fort Karugo-Narugo [S]: qm4 at Prog 0: nil: the
# default. Prog 1 and 2 (GMs): Dhea Prandoleh 135.
# Left out: the War_Lynx death handler's other-lynx side (`mob:getID() ~= TIGRESS_STRIKES_WAR_LYNX`). The zone's
# other War_Lynx-scripted mobs (17170870-17170875, War_Lynx_campaign) are Campaign mobs, not spawned outside a Campaign
# battle (`kill #17170870`: "the mob is not spawned"), and no flow statement spawns a mob; the id test is pinned by
# XI.Verify.Quests (crystalwar g2) instead. Prog 3 (a GM), a full inventory: 134, finished: the Star Globe does not fit: not completed (no
# needToZone); again: 134; freed: 134: completed.
lists WindurstWatersS/Dhea_Prandoleh/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/133 WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/134 FortKarugoNarugoS/qm4/onTrigger FortKarugoNarugoS/War_Lynx/onMobDeath
char zone=WindurstWatersS pos=4.667,-1,15.545 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.SnakeOnThePlains completed
quest CrystalWar.TheTigressStirs accepted
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # The Tigress Stirs accepted: its 131 (this check fails)
finish
quest CrystalWar.TheTigressStirs completed
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # 133
finish option=1                         # begun (any option)
warp 209.248,-30.19,54.052 FortKarugoNarugoS
trigger qm4                             # Prog 0: nil: the default
finish-if-event
warp 4.667,-1,15.545 WindurstWatersS
charvar Quest[7][18]Prog 1
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # Prog 1: 135
finish
charvar Quest[7][18]Prog 2
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # Prog 2: 135
finish
charvar Quest[7][18]Prog 3
fill-inventory
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # Prog 3: 134
finish                                  # no room: not completed
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # 134 again
finish                                  # still no room
free-inventory
trigger Dhea_Prandoleh                  # 134
finish                                  # completed; needToZone
